// Runa at the first chimney (Chimneys_1): Talonhold, "the old way up" (bible 4.2, character-bibles.md §3).
// The chimney remembers who climbed it: the ability is a fragment of the sky coming back (plant 5.6).

title: Chimneys_Runa_Climb
---
<<if has_flag("emberdown.runa.climbed")>>
    Runa: Talon, talon, breathe. You know it now. The chimneys will know you back. #still #face:bright #line:01e9ddc
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if not has_flag("emberdown.runa.counted")>>
    Runa: I don't climb with strangers. Come to the bell at dusk. Get counted. Then we'll talk about walls. #still #face:wary #line:0b825a1
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Runa: Rope's for miners who've forgotten. We climb the old way. Talons in the stone. #face:bright #line:015a541
Runa: Talon, talon, breathe. Talon, talon, name. The chimney remembers who climbed it. #plant:5.6 #face:bright #line:0b8e502
-> Birds used to fly up these. #line:05ffa92
    <<voice surveyor emberdown>>
    Runa: They did. The chimneys still have the shape of it. We're only remembering the half we can. #face:grave #line:005a063
-> Show me. #line:04b2665
    <<voice warden emberdown>>
    Runa: Go first. I sing the holds, you take them. Nobody falls while I'm singing. #face:bright #line:072c94f
-> ... #line:0c5ea54
    <<voice drift emberdown>>
    Runa: Good. Save your breath. You'll want it at the ninth. #face:bright #line:01afe09
Runa: There. Look at you. On the wall like you were born to it. #face:bright #line:042bbb7
<<grant Talonhold>>
<<flag emberdown.runa.climbed 1>>
Runa: Nine chimneys up there. Only eight of them are ours. Nobody remembers building the ninth. #face:wary #line:0a06a8e
===
